msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wow, I'll book her next time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wow, look at you, Zoey. Got a job at the Glowing Hole, huh?"
msgstr "Wow, schau dich an, Zoey. Hast einen Job im Glowing Hole, hm?"

msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Wow, really? The heart rate?"
msgstr "Wow, wirklich? Die Herzfrequenz?"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wow, that is one hell of a meltdown~ You thinking about what you'd prefer to be under there?"
